# Copy this file to `.env` and paste the key THERE. `.env` is gitignored; THIS FILE IS NOT.
#
#   cp .env.example .env      # then edit .env, never this file
#
# NEVER put a real credential in this file. On 2026-08-18 a live key was pasted here by mistake and
# had to be moved. `.gitignore` deliberately re-includes this template (`!.env.example`) so it stays
# visible to collaborators -- which means anything written here WOULD be committed.
FORTYGUARD_API_KEY=

# Nothing else here is secret. NOAA ASOS (via Iowa State) and the OpenStreetMap Overpass API are
# both free and keyless, which is why the weather and geometry layers work with no credential at all.
